12
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:25,860
Hi.

13
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,710
Over there, he's the teacher.
Here, he's the classmate.

14
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,720
Nice.

15
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,420
Did you

16
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:33,580
