So now I can say for sure,

35
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:18,560
Kaiyi,

36
00:01:19,010 --> 00:01:19,710
I like you.

37
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:23,900
(Kaiyi, I like you)

38
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:25,720
