40
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,980
So happy.

41
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:38,410
She's so happy.

42
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:42,090
From the very beginning,

43
00:01:42,090 --> 00:01:43,790
I first noticed you because...

44
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:46,030
you seemed

45
