87
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:39,720
Love makes us both braver.

88
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,190
Yeah.

89
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,060
So on this call today,

90
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,160
I really want to tell you sincerely,

91
00:03:49,850 --> 00:03:50,860
