Of course I will.

111
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,390
I will.

112
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:33,440
I've been waiting for this too.

113
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,580
(Of course I will.
I've been waiting for this too)

114
