229
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,000
I can't take this.

230
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,800
I really can't.

231
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,640
Because I feel like Cao Yiheng

232
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,480
